{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8hTckZ5HF3yo8wce9i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X8NgdNUGBZA9XuEWgC3p2K","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-005-0Ewap7/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>安心宠物医院｜社区宠物诊所</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">安心宠物医院<small>梧桐社区店</small></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n      <a href=\"#depts\">科室介绍</a>\n      <a href=\"#doctors\">医生团队</a>\n      <a href=\"#booking\">预约电话</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n        <h1>楼下就能看的宠物医院</h1>\n        <p>我们在梧桐社区开了八年，给附近的猫狗打疫苗、做体检、看急病。来之前打个电话，到店基本不用排队。</p>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#booking\">电话预约</a>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"hours\">\n        <h2>营业时间</h2>\n        <dl>\n          <dt>周一至周五</dt><dd>9:00–21:00</dd>\n          <dt>周六、周日</dt><dd>9:30–20:00</dd>\n          <dt>夜间急诊</dt><dd>21:00 以后请先来电</dd>\n        </dl>\n        <p class=\"note\">地址：梧桐路 128 号一楼，社区菜场对面</p>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"depts\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2>科室介绍</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">常见病在本院就能处理，需要大型设备的检查，我们会帮你联系合作的专科医院。</p>\n      <ul class=\"dept-list\">\n        <li>\n          <h3>内科门诊</h3>\n          <p>呕吐、腹泻、咳嗽、食欲差等常见问题，配合血常规、生化和影像检查确诊。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h3>外科与绝育</h3>\n          <p>猫狗绝育、伤口缝合、肿物切除。术前做麻醉评估，术后可以留院观察一晚。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h3>预防保健</h3>\n          <p>幼宠疫苗、狂犬疫苗、体内外驱虫和年度体检，到期前会短信提醒。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h3>皮肤科</h3>\n          <p>掉毛、瘙痒、真菌和过敏。做皮肤刮片和伍德灯检查，制定洗护和用药方案。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h3>口腔科</h3>\n          <p>洗牙、拔牙和口臭问题。老年猫狗洗牙前会先做心肺和血液检查。</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h3>影像与化验</h3>\n          <p>数字 X 光、B 超和血液化验，大部分结果当天出，医生当面讲解。</p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"doctors\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2>医生团队</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">四位执业兽医轮班坐诊，具体排班可以电话询问。</p>\n      <div class=\"doctors\">\n        <article class=\"doctor\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">陈</div>\n          <h3>陈立文</h3>\n          <p class=\"role\">院长 · 执业兽医师</p>\n          <p>从业 15 年，擅长外科手术和骨科，负责院内疑难病例会诊。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"doctor\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">许</div>\n          <h3>许晓禾</h3>\n          <p class=\"role\">内科主治</p>\n          <p>专注猫科内科，对慢性肾病、糖尿病的长期管理经验丰富。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"doctor\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">周</div>\n          <h3>周睿</h3>\n          <p class=\"role\">皮肤与口腔</p>\n          <p>处理过上千例皮肤病，同时负责洗牙和口腔手术。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"doctor\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">林</div>\n          <h3>林舒雅</h3>\n          <p class=\"role\">预防保健 · 影像</p>\n          <p>负责疫苗和体检门诊，也做 B 超和 X 光检查。说话温柔，猫咪都不太怕她。</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<section class=\"booking\" id=\"booking\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>预约电话</h2>\n      <p>门诊预约、疫苗提醒、急诊咨询都打这个号码：</p>\n      <a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:02164881234\">021-6488 1234</a>\n      <p>夜间急诊请拨：<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:13800001234\" style=\"font-size:22px;display:inline\">138 0000 1234</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h2>到店前请准备</h2>\n      <ol>\n        <li>带上之前的病历和疫苗本。</li>\n        <li>猫咪请装航空箱，狗狗请系牵引绳。</li>\n        <li>需要抽血或做手术的，提前禁食 8 小时。</li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">安心宠物医院 · 梧桐路 128 号 · 动物诊疗许可证号以店内公示为准</div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":44920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38e4fe40-1f86-415e-817b-0104af686b2a","uuid":"c56b4927-9c60-4850-8a7e-df21c786a442","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:12.265Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8hTLPJgMaJEyKy17s6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01X8NgdNUGBZA9XuEWgC3p2K":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-005-0Ewap7/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>安心宠物医院｜社区宠物诊所</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">安心宠物医院<small>梧桐社区店</small></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n      <a href=\"#depts\">科室介绍</a>\n      <a href=\"#doctors\">医生团队</a>\n      <a href=\"#booking\">预约电话</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n        <h1>楼下就能看的宠物医院</h1>\n        <p>我们在梧桐社区开了八年，给附近的猫狗打疫苗、做体检、看急病。来之前打个电话，到店基本不用排队。</p>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#booking\">电话预约</a>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"hours\">\n        <h2>营业时间</h2>\n        <dl>\n          <dt>周一至周五</dt><dd>9:00–21:00</dd>\n          <dt>周六、周日</dt><dd>9:30–20:00</dd>\n          <dt>夜间急诊</dt><dd>21:00 以后请先来电</dd>\n        </dl>\n        <p class=\"note\">地址：